comments[12]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-08-27T16:44:18.236Z","harness:codex","Duplicate check: exact phrase and all-term searches across every status returned zero matching items. Discovery evidence: pm --json --token-accounting search ... --include-body exits 2 with a structured unknown_option envelope but no token_accounting field; the transcript gate records an explicit independent transport measurement until this separate contract gap is implemented."
  "2026-08-27T16:53:58.663Z","harness:codex","Relationship rationale: pm-bfa1ob was discovered_from pm-8pnj because the versioned transcript observed the missing receipt; it recurs_from pm-t5dt4z because that closed item established self-reported token accounting, and parent pm-srns owns uniform transport envelopes."
  "2026-09-05T03:08:23.655Z","harness:codex",Opt-in refusal accounting measures the final serialized diagnostic; extension failure enrichment recalculates the receipt rather than retaining stale byte counts. Real stderr tests cover option ordering and bootstrap help refusals.
  "2026-09-05T03:22:18.641Z","harness:codex",The executable unknown-option transcript now expects self_reported accounting because diagnostic JSON carries its own final-output receipt. Full-suite first run exposed mixed source/build output during concurrent generation; a stable build and targeted compatibility rerun precede the next coverage run. No coverage threshold or source exclusion changed.
  "2026-09-05T03:27:05.265Z","harness:codex",Real CLI transcript replay passed with self-reported refusal accounting. The gate independently predicts only the added --token-accounting token in three recovery provenance fields; every other field remains exact. Negative tests reject altered recovery commands and malformed baseline transport evidence. This preserves truthful invocation metadata and byte accounting without ignoring payload drift.
  "2026-09-05T04:18:38.551Z","harness:codex","Attached exact serialized token accounting to Commander and bootstrap JSON refusals after projection and extension enrichment; strengthened independent transcript provenance verification. Final local delivery evidence: pnpm quality:static passed; 8420 tests in 608 files passed with exact coverage statements 62214/62214, branches 47182/47182, functions 12920/12920, lines 59840/59840. Full typecheck, all six linked PM test runs, package-first dogfood (88 commands), temporary Node and Bun manual workflows, packed npm/npx/bunx consumers, compatibility migration, package artifact, docs/skills, SDK surface and contract checks passed. Refusal corpus closes 117/117 probes with negative controls; task-token corpus completes 8/8 tasks at 12667 estimated tokens. Tracker-context 41 assertions, graph-composition 10 assertions, and record-integrity pass. GitHub security inventories and pnpm audit are zero; fresh required Sentry/telemetry gate passes. PR review, merge, and publication remain separate subsequent claims."
  "2026-09-05T04:47:14.288Z","harness:codex","PR 1195 review negative controls reproduced both baseline attempted_command corruption and an active error_format override replacing accounted JSON. SDK raw stderr transport now preserves JSON after final accounting for bootstrap, Commander, and known errors; baseline attempted_command must equal rendering of normalized_args. All focused regressions pass."
  "2026-09-05T04:56:22.167Z","harness:codex","PR 1195 review corrections passed 210 focused tests and full coverage: 8422 tests in 608 files; statements 62222/62222, branches 47190/47190, functions 12920/12920, lines 59845/59845. Full typecheck and ESLint pass. Context evaluation including all token surfaces and the temporary Node/Bun SDK/CLI manual workflow pass. Hosted verification of this corrected head and publication remain subsequent claims."
  "2026-09-05T05:03:40.250Z","harness:codex","Reviewed delivery: https://github.com/unbraind/pm-cli/pull/1195 . Final corrected source passed the complete pnpm quality:static suite after structured defect evidence and all terminal closures, full typecheck, 8422 tests / 608 files at exact 100/100/100/100, 55 token surfaces, and temporary Node/Bun manual workflows. All original review findings have explicit reactions and responses; three valid edge cases have reproduced red/green regressions and the pre-publication closure objection was withdrawn. GitHub dependency/code/secret alerts are zero. This source will now receive a fresh hosted review/check round; publication remains separate."
  "2026-09-05T05:41:25.019Z","harness:codex","The paired negative control reproduced this gap and now fails closed for missing/non-array normalized_args or provided_fields. Real replay also exposed the legitimate compact unknown_context_intent refusal. Its transcript now explicitly expects recovery.recovery_mode=compact; only that declared and verified mode preserves the compact shape, and its suggested_retry_args are still executed and checked in the next step. Merely adding recovery_mode=compact to an undeclared malformed pair remains a failing negative control. The corpus digest alone was updated; token ceilings are unchanged."
  "2026-09-05T05:47:54.238Z","harness:codex","PR 1195 full rereview corrections passed 63 focused tests, the real 8-task transcript gate with unchanged token ceilings, full typecheck, and the isolated 8422-test coverage suite. Coverage is statements 62222/62222, branches 47193/47193, functions 12920/12920, lines 59846/59846. Hosted CI 33946213771 passed on the previous reviewed head, including Windows; the corrected head will receive a new complete check and review round before merge."
  "2026-09-05T05:55:15.271Z","harness:codex","Final consolidated rereview correction passed pnpm quality:static after all item closures, full typecheck, 8422 tests / 608 files at exact 100/100/100/100, and the real 8-task transcript corpus. Latest pm-changelog regenerated the reviewed changelog; no active item ownership remains. The fresh canonical verifier/coverage test run has passed=2, failed=0. New hosted review and publication remain separate subsequent evidence."
